    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know... but rest isnt just sleeping for a bit. im talking about like, wanting the noise to just stop. like i'm just done. staying in this skin, dealing with everyone's looks and the constant pressure to perform... it's just too much to carry. i feel like i'm running a race with no finish line.",
