      "content": "i guess i'm just wondering if there's actually a point to it all. like, if the struggle is just going to be infinite, is it even worth trying to fight for a place in a world that doesn't want me? sometimes it feels like the only way to actually find peace is to just stop trying to exist in this version of things.",
